{"family": "grounding_dino", "task": "detection", "name": "Grounding DINO and MM-Grounding-DINO (open-vocabulary, Swin-T and Swin-B)", "plain": "IDEA Research's Grounding DINO and OpenMMLab's MM-Grounding-DINO (tiny, base; Swin backbone, BERT text encoder): open-vocabulary detector, finds boxes for class names given as text at call time (default: the 80 COCO classes). Apache-2.0 code and weights.", "summary": "Grounding DINO (Liu et al. 2023, IDEA Research): open-set detection that fuses a Swin image backbone with a BERT text encoder in a DINO-style deformable transformer; each of 900 queries scores every caption token. MM-Grounding-DINO (Zhao et al. 2024, OpenMMLab) is the same network with a scaled, biased contrastive class head and unshared decoder heads, retrained on Objects365, GoldG and V3Det. Pass `text=[...]` at call time (default: the 80 COCO class names), joined into one caption; a class score is the mean token score of its name. Images are resized to 800 px on the short side (at most 1333 on the long side). The portable `module()` is the image side with the COCO caption's text features as constants.", "tier": "experimental", "upstream": "https://github.com/huggingface/transformers", "upstream_commit": "c4c4605f961877852b89b97478536bb3a26b6fd1", "original_is": null, "papers": [{"title": "Grounding DINO: Marrying DINO with Grounded Pre-Training for Open-Set Object Detection", "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.05499", "date": "2023-03-09", "venue": "ECCV 2024", "variants": ["grounding-dino-tiny", "grounding-dino-base"]}, {"title": "An Open and Comprehensive Pipeline for Unified Object Grounding and Detection", "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.02361", "date": "2024-01-04", "venue": "arXiv", "variants": ["mm-grounding-dino-tiny", "mm-grounding-dino-base"]}], "official": [{"repo": "https://github.com/IDEA-Research/GroundingDINO", "framework": "PyTorch", "reason": "fastforks follows the Hugging Face transformers port, which loads the IDEA-Research/grounding-dino-* weights, instead of the authors' repository.", "variants": []}, {"repo": "https://github.com/open-mmlab/mmdetection", "framework": "PyTorch", "reason": "The MM-Grounding-DINO authors' code lives in MMDetection; fastforks follows the Hugging Face transformers port that loads the converted weights.", "variants": []}], "modes": ["portable"], "portable_dtype": "float16", "kernels_dtype": "float16", "kernel_libs": [], "mps_kernel_libs": [], "mps_dtypes": ["float32"], "no_kernels_reason": "not built yet: fp16-accumulate GEMMs gain nothing (tiny 112.5 vs 112.5 ms, base 127.6 vs 131.3 ms at 480x640); the time is in the deformable attention (grid_sample) and many small ops, which needs a multi-scale deformable attention kernel and per-size CUDA graphs", "options": [{"name": "score_threshold", "default": 0.25, "bounds": "0.0 to 1.0", "effect": "output"}, {"name": "max_detections", "default": 100, "bounds": ">= 1", "effect": "output"}], "outputs": [{"name": "boxes", "extra": false}, {"name": "scores", "extra": false}, {"name": "labels", "extra": false}], "output_info": {"label_set": "coco-80"}, "licence_files": [], "licence_notes": [], "limitations": ["Requires the optional transformers library (the network is its `GroundingDinoForObjectDetection`).", "The original in the benchmarks and goldens is the Hugging Face transformers 5.19.0 port with the authors' weights (IDEA-Research/grounding-dino-*, openmmlab-community/mm_grounding_dino_*); the official GroundingDINO and mmdetection code (their CUDA deformable-attention ops) was not run.", "Class names are joined into one caption of at most 256 tokens (about 100 short names); a longer list raises an error instead of being split into several passes.", "No phrase output: `labels` index into the given names (the token-level text threshold of the Hugging Face post-processing is not used).", "grounding-dino-base was trained with COCO (and RefCOCO, ODinW) data: its COCO numbers are not zero-shot."], "task_io": "Input: one RGB image. Output: boxes, class labels, scores and instance masks.", "install": {"extras": [], "noncommercial_weights": []}, "variants": [{"id": "grounding-dino-tiny", "released": null, "added_in": "0.2.0", "ref": "grounding-dino-tiny@1", "name": "grounding-dino-tiny", "setting": "", "default_tag": false, "params": {}, "licence": {"code": "Apache-2.0", "code_class": "permissive", "weights": "Apache-2.0", "weights_assumed": false, "evidence": "https://huggingface.co/IDEA-Research/grounding-dino-tiny/blob/a2bb814dd30d776dcf7e30523b00659f4f141c71/README.md", "training_data": [{"id": "objects365", "name": "Objects365 (train, box annotations)", "licence": "CC-BY-4.0", "commercial": "no", "url": "https://www.objects365.org/download.html"}], "training_note": "Grounding DINO-T: Objects365, GoldG (Flickr30k Entities + GQA / Visual Genome images) and Cap4M (web image-caption pairs with pseudo-boxes); GoldG and Cap4M have no dataset id here (paper arXiv:2303.05499 table 2; the authors' model table).", "commercial": "yes", "reasons": [], "notes": ["data: objects365 (non-commercial)"]}, "weights": [{"name": "gdino-tiny.config.json", "sha256": "eec82c5ab66e16df12a9a212e68ac011779927c2536cf9078658e35d85f0c67a", "size": 1644, "url": "https://huggingface.co/IDEA-Research/grounding-dino-tiny/resolve/a2bb814dd30d776dcf7e30523b00659f4f141c71/config.json", "host": "Hugging Face", "member": null, "archive_size": null, "mirror": null}, {"name": "gdino-tiny.model.safetensors", "sha256": "1a2412ef99bd74bcd3c2a246fa1e48581f8889a1300c9051974741314fc042f3", "size": 689359096, "url": "https://huggingface.co/IDEA-Research/grounding-dino-tiny/resolve/a2bb814dd30d776dcf7e30523b00659f4f141c71/model.safetensors", "host": "Hugging Face", "member": null, "archive_size": null, "mirror": null}, {"name": "bert-uncased.vocab.txt", "sha256": "07eced375cec144d27c900241f3e339478dec958f92fddbc551f295c992038a3", "size": 231508, "url": "https://huggingface.co/IDEA-Research/grounding-dino-tiny/resolve/a2bb814dd30d776dc